{"page":170,"width":1652,"height":2368,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"IIIZ","words":[{"text":"IIIZ","x":229,"y":785,"width":61,"height":44}]},{"text":"배열을 A卜협하여 리스트를 구현하면 장점과 단심이 존재한다. 장심은 구현이 간단하고 속도가","words":[{"text":"배열을","x":426,"y":193,"width":81,"height":31},{"text":"A卜협하여","x":517,"y":192,"width":103,"height":32},{"text":"리스트를","x":633,"y":193,"width":103,"height":31},{"text":"구현하면","x":746,"y":192,"width":105,"height":31},{"text":"장점과","x":862,"y":192,"width":79,"height":31},{"text":"단심이","x":950,"y":192,"width":78,"height":31},{"text":"존재한다.","x":1041,"y":192,"width":116,"height":32},{"text":"장심은","x":1173,"y":192,"width":84,"height":31},{"text":"구현이","x":1268,"y":192,"width":82,"height":31},{"text":"간단하고","x":1365,"y":191,"width":111,"height":31},{"text":"속도가","x":1486,"y":190,"width":74,"height":34}]},{"text":"빠르다는 것이다. 단점으로는 리스트의 크기가 고정된디는 것을 들 수 있다. 즉 배열의 특성상","words":[{"text":"빠르다는","x":394,"y":245,"width":110,"height":30},{"text":"것이다.","x":518,"y":245,"width":82,"height":31},{"text":"단점으로는","x":616,"y":244,"width":132,"height":31},{"text":"리스트의","x":760,"y":243,"width":102,"height":32},{"text":"크기가","x":877,"y":243,"width":80,"height":32},{"text":"고정된디는","x":968,"y":243,"width":136,"height":32},{"text":"것을","x":1119,"y":244,"width":54,"height":31},{"text":"들","x":1185,"y":245,"width":28,"height":29},{"text":"수","x":1226,"y":245,"width":29,"height":30},{"text":"있다.","x":1269,"y":245,"width":63,"height":30},{"text":"즉","x":1349,"y":246,"width":29,"height":28},{"text":"배열의","x":1392,"y":243,"width":80,"height":31},{"text":"특성상","x":1487,"y":243,"width":73,"height":34}]},{"text":"동적으로 크기를 늘리거나 줄이는 것이 힘들다. 따라서 만약 데이터를 추가하고 싶은데 더 이상","words":[{"text":"동적으로","x":393,"y":296,"width":111,"height":31},{"text":"크기를","x":514,"y":297,"width":79,"height":31},{"text":"늘리거나","x":603,"y":295,"width":106,"height":32},{"text":"줄이는","x":719,"y":296,"width":79,"height":31},{"text":"것이","x":810,"y":295,"width":48,"height":32},{"text":"힘들다.","x":872,"y":295,"width":85,"